<title>HONG KONG: Henderson Land seen in HK$3.0 bln loan.</title>
<headline>Henderson Land seen in HK$3.0 bln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henderson Land Development Co is seeking funding via a HK$3.0 billion revolving credit facility, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility matures in five years and repayment is in bullet form. The deal pays an all-in return of 57 basis points over the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Henderson Land was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
